+- Moving a member (`/members/{uid}/move`) removes the user from the project in the path and adds them to `toProjectId` with the same role. It is an
+  all-or-nothing change:
+  - Only managers may move members, and only when they are managers of both the source and the target project (else 403). Archived source or target → 409.
